#: ../../chapter2.rst:24
msgid "Two Deployment Scenarios"
msgstr "To implementeringsscenarier"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:25
msgid ""
"The services can be deployed in flexible combinations to meet different "
"needs. There are two primary ways to deploy |prodname|."
msgstr "Tjenesterne kan implementeres i fleksible kombinationer for at imødekomme forskellige behov. Der er to primære måder at implementere |prodname| på."

#: ../../chapter2.rst:27
msgid ""
"Deploy in the same site as the File Servers and Active Directory domain "
"controllers:"
msgstr "Udrul i samme site som filserverne og Active Directory-domænecontrollere:"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:31
msgid ""
"Deploy in a site remote, such as Amazon Web Services EC2, Microsoft "
"Azure, or in a Data Center where the Managed Service Provider (MSP) hosts"
" their infrastructure:"
msgstr "Udrul i et fjerntliggende site, såsom Amazon Web Services EC2, Microsoft Azure, eller i et Data Center, hvor Managed Service Provider (MSP) hoster deres infrastruktur:"

