#: ../../chapter2.rst:61
msgid ""
"When a new |prodname| account (Tenant Account) is created, any of these "
"services can be selected to power the tenant's root storage folder. And, "
"regardless of which provider you select here, additional services can be "
"mounted below the root of the tenants' storage tree where they will "
"appear as a sub-folder in the root folder."
msgstr "Når en ny |prodname| konto (Tenant-konto) oprettes, kan en af disse tjenester vælges til at drive tenantens rodmappe til opbevaring. Uanset hvilken udbyder du vælger her, kan yderligere tjenester monteres under roden af tenantens opbevaringstræ, hvor de vil fremstå som en undermappe i rodmappe."

#: ../../chapter2.rst:65
msgid "|prodname| Server Farm (Cluster)"
msgstr "|prodname| Serverfarm (Klynge)"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:67
msgid ""
"The |prodname| Cluster (One or more |prodname| servers) provides the "
"access infrastructure and management services and acts as a liaison "
"between the user-facing access clients and the backend storage services. "
"It consists of a group of web services which include:"
msgstr "Den |prodname| klynge (en eller flere |prodname| servere) leverer adgangsinfrastrukturen og administrationstjenesterne og fungerer som et bindeled mellem de brugerorienterede adgangsklienter og backend lagringstjenesterne. Den består af en gruppe af webtjenester, som inkluderer:"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:69
msgid "Account Management"
msgstr "Konto Administration"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:70
msgid "Login and User Load Balancing"
msgstr "Login og brugerbelastningsfordeling"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:71
msgid "Web Portal UI"
msgstr "Webportal UI"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:72
msgid "Generic Storage Services (powered by backend provider)"
msgstr "Generiske lagringstjenester (drevet af backend-udbyder)"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:73
msgid "Data Persistence"
msgstr "Data Persistens"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:74
msgid "Local Storage/Device Relay"
msgstr "Lokal lagring/Enhedsrelay"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:76
msgid ""
"These services can be deployed in flexible combinations to meet different"
" needs."
msgstr "Disse tjenester kan implementeres i fleksible kombinationer for at opfylde forskellige behov."

#: ../../chapter2.rst:78
msgid ""
"|prodname| has an all-in-one installer, so it can easily be self-hosted "
"by you or you can use the one hosted already in the cloud."
msgstr "|prodname| har en alt-i-én-installationsprogram, så det kan nemt hostes af dig, eller du kan bruge den, der allerede er hostet i skyen."

#: ../../chapter2.rst:83
msgid "|prodname| Client Agent Software"
msgstr "|prodname| Client Agent Software"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:85
msgid ""
"The |prodname| Clients enable the use of |prodname| services. Supported "
"clients include:"
msgstr "Klienterne til |prodname| muliggør brugen af |prodname| tjenester. Understøttede klienter inkluderer:"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:87
msgid "Desktop Client for Windows"
msgstr "Desktopklient til Windows"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:88
msgid "Desktop Client for Mac"
msgstr "Desktopklient til Mac"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:89
msgid "Server Agent for Windows Server (background sync)"
msgstr "Serveragent til Windows Server (baggrundssynkronisering)"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:90
msgid "iOS client for iPhone and iPad"
msgstr "iOS-klient til iPhone og iPad"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:91
msgid "Android Client"
msgstr "Android-klient"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:92
msgid "Windows Phone Client"
msgstr "Windows Phone-klient"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:93
msgid "Windows Tablet Client"
msgstr "Windows Tablet-klient"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:94
msgid "Web Client (Internet Explorer, Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Opera and etc)"
msgstr "Webklient (Internet Explorer, Chrome, Safari, Firefox, Opera osv.)"

#: ../../chapter2.rst:96
msgid ""
"These clients allow native use of cloud storage on the corresponding "
"device through a mapped drive, file share or whatever mechanism is "
"commonly used to access files. This makes it easy for a user to access "
"all their files with any device or share them with users of any device."
msgstr "Disse klienter tillader nativ brug af cloud-lagring på den tilsvarende enhed gennem et tildelt drev, fildeling eller hvilken som helst mekanisme, der almindeligvis bruges til at få adgang til filer. Dette gør det let for en bruger at få adgang til alle deres filer med enhver enhed eller dele dem med brugere af enhver enhed."

#: ../../chapter2.rst:98
msgid ""
"Each client tries to keep things familiar for the end user. For example, "
"the server client integrates cloud storage with file shares so that "
"shared cloud folders can be easily published as file shares with access "
"controls that can be based on existing Active Directory identities and "
"the desktop client maintains a mapped drive view of the cloud storage "
"which operates like any other drive on the desktop."
msgstr "Hver klient forsøger at holde tingene genkendelige for slutbrugeren. For eksempel integrerer serverklienten cloudlagring med fildelinger, så delt cloudlagring nemt kan publiceres som fildelinger med adgangskontrol, der kan baseres på eksisterende Active Directory-identiteter, og desktopklienten opretholder et kortlagt drevsyn på cloudlagringen, som fungerer som ethvert andet drev på desktoppen."

